      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ given below.\nWhich entries of $A$ could be replaced by $0$ in order to get a matrix in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -7 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -9 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
